      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-12-05T00:05:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>\n&gt; </p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>Aided and abetted for a few hours\n</p>\n<p>That's it.</p>\n<p>Pack it up.</p>\n<p>It's over.</p>\n<p>The Letters Page can never top this moment. XD</p>\n<p>That was really good! I got all kinds of ideas for a villain deck, though they never did say what this team should be called. I do love how evil R63 Setback is such a temptress. Really great use of all the characters for making good villain stories, and I like the Revenants too. :D</p>\n<p>Was anyone else expecting the final reveal to be Benchmark? I figure he'd be some unstoppable juggernaught they can barely keep under control.</p>",
